Feature: Display Grouped Tab for Grouped Resource Publish Requests

Scenario: Requester sees Grouped Tab after submitting a Grouped Resource Publish request

Given a Requester has never seen the Grouped Tab in the V3 Approvals List
And the Requester submits a Grouped Resource Publish request
When the request is processed
Then the Grouped Tab is displayed in the V3 Approvals List for the Requester

Python:

from behave import given, when, then

@given('a Requester has never seen the Grouped Tab in the V3 Approvals List')
def step_impl(context):
    context.requester_has_seen_grouped_tab = False

@given('the Requester submits a Grouped Resource Publish request')
def step_impl(context):
    context.submitted_grouped_request = True

@when('the request is processed')
def step_impl(context):
    context.request_processed = True

@then('the Grouped Tab is displayed in the V3 Approvals List for the Requester')
def step_impl(context):
    assert context.requester_has_seen_grouped_tab == False
    assert context.submitted_grouped_request == True
    assert context.request_processed == True
    context.requester_has_seen_grouped_tab = True
    assert context.requester_has_seen_grouped_tab == True
